shoot:description:I went on a quick trip to Florida and brought along my smaller OM-System camera.  I didn't go on any long dedicated birding outings, but did get a few "gimme" lifers, and some unexpected ones, including Roseate Spoonbill!  I also went on a 2-hour boat ride to see some dolphins, where I saw a few lifer Yellow-crowned Night Herons and a pair of Black Vultures.  Over the whole trip there were herons and egrets everywhere, including many juveniles.  Despite the heat and humidity I'm looking forward to going back sometime.
